00:16:40,080 --> 00:16:40,910
Yugi!

252
00:16:40,993 --> 00:16:45,580
I may not have defeated you, Yugi,
but I can still eliminate you!

253
00:16:48,700 --> 00:16:49,530
Yugi!

254
00:16:50,480 --> 00:16:52,160
He's trapped by the fire!

255
00:16:52,740 --> 00:16:54,300
And he can't escape!

256
00:16:54,660 --> 00:16:57,360
We'll see who's the coward now! Fire!

257
00:17:02,900 --> 00:17:05,720
Yugi's going to be fried to a crisp! Yugi!

258
00:17:05,980 --> 00:17:07,156
Jump out of the way!

259
00:17:13,900 --> 00:17:18,137
you survived how can this be it's

260
00:17:18,220 --> 00:17:21,197
impossible my millennium puzzle protects

261
00:17:21,280 --> 00:17:28,020
me from your cowardly assault but
nothing will protect you from oblivion

262
00:17:39,600 --> 00:17:41,520
Yugi, you were incredible.

263
00:17:41,960 --> 00:17:44,797
Your Millennium Puzzle has
more power than we thought.

264
00:17:44,880 --> 00:17:49,527
Not only did it protect Yugi, but it also
saved all of us from the flames, too.

265
00:17:51,260 --> 00:17:53,600
Yugi, I don't know what to say.

266
00:17:55,300 --> 00:17:56,130
Here.

267
00:17:56,213 --> 00:17:57,620
These star chips are yours.

268
00:18:00,960 --> 00:18:04,220
They're yours. Take them. Go on.

269
00:18:04,600 --> 00:18:07,120
I'm sorry, but I can't accept them.

270
00:18:07,340 --> 00:18:08,820
I fight my own battles.

271
00:18:10,760 --> 00:18:12,800
Mai, Yugi battled for you.

272
00:18:13,080 --> 00:18:15,433
He risked his life in this duel for you.

273
00:18:15,580 --> 00:18:16,597
I know, but...

274
00:18:16,680 --> 00:18:18,217
There's no point in arguing.

275
00:18:18,300 --> 00:18:19,888
She's way too thick-headed.

276
00:18:21,740 --> 00:18:25,269
But if she'd rather be booted
off the island, I'll take him.

277
00:18:28,280 --> 00:18:31,857
You think me losing all my star
chips is funny, Joey Wheeler?

278
00:18:31,940 --> 00:18:33,999
I thought you didn't want him, Mai.

279
00:18:34,940 --> 00:18:35,980
Give him back!

280
00:18:36,340 --> 00:18:37,877
Of course you can have him.

281
00:18:37,960 --> 00:18:38,790
They're yours.

282
00:18:40,640 --> 00:18:42,180
Uh, really, Joey?

283
00:18:42,780 --> 00:18:44,677
Didn't you learn anything from this duel?

284
00:18:44,760 --> 00:18:46,977
You can't always keep your defenses up.

285
00:18:47,060 --> 00:18:49,917
Because they'll just
get between you and the

286
00:18:50,000 --> 00:18:52,765
other people who are
trying to be your friends.

287
00:18:53,440 --> 00:18:55,660
So can't you let your shield down?

288
00:18:55,860 --> 00:18:57,620
Just this one time?

289
00:18:58,380 --> 00:18:59,210
Hmm?

290
00:19:00,100 --> 00:19:00,930
Hmm?

291
00:19:02,100 --> 00:19:02,930
Ha!

292
00:19:03,013 --> 00:19:05,140
I'm such a sensitive guy!

293
00:19:05,920 --> 00:19:08,137
Yeah, when you're not being a pain.

294
00:19:08,220 --> 00:19:09,860
Which is most of the time.

295
00:19:10,460 --> 00:19:12,460
Ah, my adoring fans.

296
00:19:15,180 --> 00:19:16,220
Yugi, wait.

297
00:19:17,940 --> 00:19:20,097
I'll repay you for what you did today.

298
00:19:20,180 --> 00:19:21,277
You're the one who won these.

299
00:19:21,360 --> 00:19:23,772
So far as I'm concerned, I still owe you.

300
00:19:24,480 --> 00:19:26,400
More than I've ever owed anyone.

301
00:19:26,760 --> 00:19:31,360
And when we finally do face each other
in a duel, it'll be an honorable one.

302
00:19:31,720 --> 00:19:32,640
Sounds good.

303
00:19:32,980 --> 00:19:34,760
Yes, an honorable one.

304
00:19:37,820 --> 00:19:40,300
That's a duel I'd look forward to, my.
